\nDesigned for server-side deployment: field devices with MQTT Proxy enabled upload positions via MQTT, and this bridge forwards them to CalTopo as dots under Realtime Data \u2192 Shared Locations.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n- PSK decryption for encrypted Meshtastic channels (AES-128/256)\r\n- Multi-gateway deduplication (multiple phones uploading \u2192 single CalTopo update)\r\n- Node info gating (waits for device name before forwarding)\r\n- Configurable ID formats (hex, short_hex, long_hex, short, long)\r\n\r\nRequirements: CalTopo Teams account + Connect Key, MQTT broker (public or private), Python 3.10+. Includes systemd service file for headless operation.", "name": "Meshtastic MQTT CalTopo Bridge", "name_with_namespace": "Dan Dawson / Meshtastic MQTT CalTopo Bridge", "path": "meshtastic-mqtt-caltopo-bridge", "path_with_namespace": "DanDawson/meshtastic-mqtt-caltopo-bridge", "created_at": "2026-01-03T03:45:11.248Z", "default_branch": "main", "tag_list": ["CalTopo", "meshtastic"], "topics": ["CalTopo", "meshtastic"], "ssh_url_to_repo": "git@gitlab.com:DanDawson/meshtastic-mqtt-caltopo-bridge.git", "http_url_to_repo": "https://gitlab.com/DanDawson/meshtastic-mqtt-caltopo-bridge.git", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/DanDawson/meshtastic-mqtt-caltopo-bridge", "readme_url": "https://gitlab.com/DanDawson/meshtastic-mqtt-caltopo-bridge/-/blob/main/README.md", "forks_count": 0, "avatar_url": null, "star_count": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-01-20T02:58:52.354Z", "visibility": "public", "namespace": {"id": 1542040, "name": "Dan Dawson", "path": "DanDawson", "kind": "user", "full_path": "DanDawson", "parent_id": null, "avatar_url": "/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/1284678/avatar.png?v=1794219470", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/DanDawson"}}, {"id": 76001859, "description": "custom checkmk mqtt broker check", "name": "check_mqtt_broker", "name_with_namespace": "Tibor Molnar / check_mqtt_broker", "path": "check_mqtt_broker", "path_with_namespace": "csibman27/check_mqtt_broker",